			"notes": "shadowclient 0.2.0 release notes\n\nnew features:\n- descriptions for modules\n- added configurable keybindings (in the mc keybinding menu)\n- added small chat message for toggling modules\n- added sodium/optifine detection\n- notifications system\n- timer speeds can now go below 1\n\nnew modules:\n- death notification\n- xray\n- trajectories\n- freecam\n- blink (hidden because broken)\n- ms ping display\n- shadow hud (minimalistic hud)\n\nfixes:\n- fixed window title not being overwritten properly\n- refactored some of my terrible code\n- updated the welcome message to look better\n- removed fabric api being necessary\n- moved jars to another folder\n- fixed not being jump with bhopping\n- fixed lots of potential crashes\n- fixed enum settings not being saved properly\n- fixed slider setting precision always being 3 digits"
		},
